Manage spec lifecycle statuses (promote, demote, set, status)

Usage: specsync lifecycle [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  promote       Advance a spec to the next lifecycle status
  demote        Move a spec back to the previous lifecycle status
  set           Set a spec to a specific lifecycle status
  status        Show lifecycle status of specs (all or filtered)
  history       Show transition history for a spec
  guard         Dry-run guard evaluation — check if a transition would pass guards
  auto-promote  Auto-promote all specs that pass their guards
  enforce       CI enforcement — validate lifecycle rules, exit non-zero on violations
